"<h2 class=\"ko\">Mutation instable</h2>{0}<div class=\"relics\"><div class=\"relic mutx\">{1}<span><b>{2}</b>{3}</span></div></div><p>Elle remplace la précédente pendant 5 nuits, puis une autre mutation instable prendra sa place.</p><button type=\"button\" class=\"go\" data-a=\"dawn\">Continuer</button>":"<h2 class=\"ko\">Unstable mutation</h2>{0}<div class=\"relics\"><div class=\"relic mutx\">{1}<span><b>{2}</b>{3}</span></div></div><p>It replaces the previous one for 5 nights, then another unstable mutation will take its place.</p><button type=\"button\" class=\"go\" data-a=\"dawn\">Continue</button>",
"<h2 class=\"ok\">Nuit {0} survécue</h2>{1}<p>Dans les décombres, tu trouves un objet rare. Choisis une <b>relique</b> : elle reste active toute la partie.</p>\n   <div class=\"relics\">{2}</div>":"<h2 class=\"ok\">Night {0} survived</h2>{1}<p>In the rubble, you find a rare item. Choose a <b>relic</b>: it stays active for the whole run.</p>\n   <div class=\"relics\">{2}</div>",
