"<h2 class=\"ok\">Niveau {0} !</h2>{1}<p><b>{2}</b>{3} a tué <b>{4} zombies</b>. Choisis son amélioration, elle dure toute la partie :</p>{5}\n   <div class=\"relics\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"relic\" data-a=\"lvl\" data-v=\"atk\">{6}<span><b>Offensive</b>+1 dégât à chaque coup</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"relic\" data-a=\"lvl\" data-v=\"def\">{7}<span><b>Défensive</b>+3 PV max, et tous ses PV récupérés</span></button></div>":"<h2 class=\"ok\">Level {0}!</h2>{1}<p><b>{2}</b>{3} has killed <b>{4} zombies</b>. Choose their upgrade, it lasts the whole run:</p>{5}\n   <div class=\"relics\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"relic\" data-a=\"lvl\" data-v=\"atk\">{6}<span><b>Offense</b>+1 damage on every hit</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"relic\" data-a=\"lvl\" data-v=\"def\">{7}<span><b>Defense</b>+3 max HP, and all HP restored</span></button></div>",
