"<h2 class=\"ok\">Nuit {0} survécue</h2>{1}<p>Choisis une carte de <b>ta pioche</b> que tu auras <b>en main demain</b>.</p>\n   {2}\n   <div class=\"picks\">{3}</div>\n   <button type=\"button\" class=\"skip\" data-a=\"draft\" data-v=\"\">Ne rien prendre</button>":"<h2 class=\"ok\">Night {0} survived</h2>{1}<p>Choose a card from <b>your draw pile</b> to have <b>in hand tomorrow</b>.</p>\n   {2}\n   <div class=\"picks\">{3}</div>\n   <button type=\"button\" class=\"skip\" data-a=\"draft\" data-v=\"\">Take nothing</button>",
