"<h2 class=\"pw\">Le troc de l’aube</h2><p>Tu as <b>{0} ferraille</b>. Un zombie éliminé rapporte 1 ferraille, un boss 15. Économise pour ce qui compte. {1}Munitions anti-Colosse : <b>{2}/{3}</b>.</p>\n  <div class=\"shop\">{4}{5}{6}{7}</div>\n  <button type=\"button\" class=\"go\" data-a=\"nightpick\">Continuer</button>":"<h2 class=\"pw\">The dawn barter</h2><p>You have <b>{0} scrap</b>. A zombie killed gives 1 scrap, a boss 15. Save up for what matters. {1}Anti-Colossus rounds: <b>{2}/{3}</b>.</p>\n  <div class=\"shop\">{4}{5}{6}{7}</div>\n  <button type=\"button\" class=\"go\" data-a=\"nightpick\">Continue</button>",
