"<img class=\"heli\" src=\"assets/ui/heli.webp?v=121\" alt=\"\"><h2 class=\"ok\">Les secours sont là !</h2><p>À l’aube de la nuit {0}, un hélicoptère se pose devant l’abri. Tu as tenu.</p><i class=\"bigstamp ok\">Victoire{1}</i>\n  <p><b>{2}</b> zombies éliminés.{3}</p>{4}{5}{6}{7}{8}{9}\n  <button type=\"button\" class=\"go\" data-a=\"win-leave\">Partir avec les secours</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"skip\" data-a=\"win-stay\">Rester : une nuit de plus (mode infini, pour le score)</button>\n  <p class=\"ver\">Si tu restes, ta victoire est déjà acquise : la horde grandit chaque nuit, jusqu’à ce qu’elle gagne.</p>":"<img class=\"heli\" src=\"assets/ui/heli.webp?v=121\" alt=\"\"><h2 class=\"ok\">Help has arrived!</h2><p>At the dawn of night {0}, a helicopter lands in front of the shelter. You held out.</p><i class=\"bigstamp ok\">Victory{1}</i>\n  <p><b>{2}</b> zombies killed.{3}</p>{4}{5}{6}{7}{8}{9}\n  <button type=\"button\" class=\"go\" data-a=\"win-leave\">Leave with the rescue</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"skip\" data-a=\"win-stay\">Stay: one more night (endless mode, for the score)</button>\n  <p class=\"ver\">If you stay, your victory is already secured: the horde grows every night, until it wins.</p>",
