"<h2 class=\"pw\">Collection</h2><p>Tu as <b>{0}</b> points de survie. Chaque partie en rapporte : 10 par nuit survécue, plus 1 tous les 4 zombies. Une carte débloquée l’est pour toujours.</p>\n  <div class=\"csum\"><span class=\"cs-in\">{1}/{2} débloquées</span><span class=\"cs-buy\">{3} {4} à portée</span></div>\n  <button type=\"button\" class=\"skip evob\" data-a=\"evo\">✦ Évolutions secrètes · {5}/{6} découvertes</button>\n  {7}{8}\n  <button type=\"button\" class=\"go\" data-a=\"new\">Préparer une partie</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"skip\" data-a=\"title\">Accueil</button>":"<h2 class=\"pw\">Collection</h2><p>You have <b>{0}</b> survival points. Every run earns some: 10 per night survived, plus 1 every 4 zombies. A card you unlock stays unlocked forever.</p>\n  <div class=\"csum\"><span class=\"cs-in\">{1}/{2} unlocked</span><span class=\"cs-buy\">{3} {4} affordable</span></div>\n  <button type=\"button\" class=\"skip evob\" data-a=\"evo\">✦ Secret evolutions · {5}/{6} discovered</button>\n  {7}{8}\n  <button type=\"button\" class=\"go\" data-a=\"new\">Prepare a run</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"skip\" data-a=\"title\">Home</button>",
