"<h2 class=\"ko\">Recommencer ?</h2><p>La partie en cours sera <b>perdue</b>, sans points de survie.</p><button type=\"button\" class=\"go\" data-a=\"prestart2\">Oui, recommencer</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"skip\" data-a=\"pmenu\">Non, retour</button>":"<h2 class=\"ko\">Start over?</h2><p>The current run will be <b>lost</b>, with no survival points.</p><button type=\"button\" class=\"go\" data-a=\"prestart2\">Yes, start over</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"skip\" data-a=\"pmenu\">No, go back</button>",
"<h2 class=\"pw\">Règles du jeu</h2>{0}<button type=\"button\" class=\"skip\" data-a=\"retuto\">Rejouer la première nuit guidée</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"go\" data-a=\"title\">Retour</button>":"<h2 class=\"pw\">Rules</h2>{0}<button type=\"button\" class=\"skip\" data-a=\"retuto\">Replay the guided first night</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"go\" data-a=\"title\">Back</button>",
"<h2 class=\"pw\">Le bestiaire</h2><p>Les zombies de la horde et leurs mutations. Tes cartes sont dans la Collection.</p>{0}<h2 class=\"pw\">Les mutations instables</h2><p>Une seule à la fois, elle change toutes les 5 nuits.</p><div class=\"deck\">{1}</div><button type=\"button\" class=\"go\" data-a=\"title\">Retour</button>":"<h2 class=\"pw\">Bestiary</h2><p>The zombies of the horde and their mutations. Your cards are in the Collection.</p>{0}<h2 class=\"pw\">Unstable mutations</h2><p>Only one at a time, it changes every 5 nights.</p><div class=\"deck\">{1}</div><button type=\"button\" class=\"go\" data-a=\"title\">Back</button>",
"<p>Ajouté à ton deck : <b>{0}</b>.</p>":"<p>Added to your deck: <b>{0}</b>.</p>",
"<h2 class=\"pw\">{0}</h2><p>{1}</p>{2}<button type=\"button\" class=\"go\" data-a=\"todraft\">Continuer</button>":"<h2 class=\"pw\">{0}</h2><p>{1}</p>{2}<button type=\"button\" class=\"go\" data-a=\"todraft\">Continue</button>",
"Toutes les cartes de ce type seront améliorées, y compris celles déjà posées.":"All cards of this type will be upgraded, including those already placed.",
"Une carte de ce type quitte ton deck pour cette partie (les unités posées ne comptent pas).":"A card of this type leaves your deck for this run (placed units don't count).",
"{0} dans {1} nuits au total":"{0} at {1} total nights",
