"<p class=\"ver\">Sur iPhone : Partager → « Sur l’écran d’accueil » pour jouer en plein écran.</p>":"<p class=\"ver\">On iPhone: Share → “Add to Home Screen” to play full screen.</p>",
"<h1 class=\"logo\">{0}</h1><p>Tiens <b>{1} nuits</b> jusqu’à l’arrivée des secours… ou reste pour <b>une nuit de plus</b>. Chaque nuit, la horde est plus nombreuse et plus coriace.</p>{2}\n\n{3}{4}\n{5}\n<div class=\"bgrid\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"skip\" data-a=\"rules\">Règles du jeu</button>{6}<button type=\"button\" class=\"skip\" data-a=\"daily\">Défi du jour</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"skip\" data-a=\"deck\">Bestiaire</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"skip\" data-a=\"stats\">Statistiques</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"skip\" data-a=\"achs\">{7} Succès · {8}/{9}</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"skip\" data-a=\"options\">{10} Options</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"skip\" data-a=\"testmode\">Mode test</button></div>{11}<p class=\"ver\">Sons : Kenney (kenney.nl), artisticdude et saturn91 (OpenGameArt), sous licence CC0 ; La Sonothèque, Pixabay, Sound Fishing (détails dans CREDITS.md).</p><p class=\"ver\">{12}</p>":"<h1 class=\"logo\">{0}</h1><p>Hold out for <b>{1} nights</b> until help arrives… or stay for <b>one more night</b>. Each night, the horde grows larger and tougher.</p>{2}\n\n{3}{4}\n{5}\n<div class=\"bgrid\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"skip\" data-a=\"rules\">Rules</button>{6}<button type=\"button\" class=\"skip\" data-a=\"daily\">Daily challenge</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"skip\" data-a=\"deck\">Bestiary</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"skip\" data-a=\"stats\">Statistics</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"skip\" data-a=\"achs\">{7} Achievements · {8}/{9}</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"skip\" data-a=\"options\">{10} Options</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"skip\" data-a=\"testmode\">Test mode</button></div>{11}<p class=\"ver\">Sounds: Kenney (kenney.nl), artisticdude and saturn91 (OpenGameArt), under CC0 license; La Sonothèque, Pixabay, Sound Fishing (details in CREDITS.md).</p><p class=\"ver\">{12}</p>",
